{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.BringsSmoothnessResolution","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.BringsSmoothnessResolution","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.brings_smoothness_resolution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.brings_smoothness_resolution","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/brings-smoothness-resolution.lean#L67-L79","doc":"**Conditional form of `prop:brings-smoothness-resolution`.**\n\nGiven the three conditions, their conjunction holds. **This is not a proof of the block's\nclaim** and must not be cited as one: it is an accessor, and by\n`QOU.ProofHygiene.SelfAssumingContexts.tuple_contentless` the carrier is inhabited exactly\nwhen the conjunction is, so the declaration carries no content of its own.\n\nIt is kept under this name because `brings-smoothness-resolution.ts` resolves its\n`lean.ref` here; what has changed is that the content is now visibly in the hypothesis\nrather than invisibly in a `True`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:brings-smoothness-resolution","label":"prop:brings-smoothness-resolution","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/brings-smoothness-resolution.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BringSurfaceSmoothness.regular_foliation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BringSurfaceSmoothness.regular_foliation","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/brings-smoothness-resolution.lean#L65-L65","doc":"The radial parameter r = |w_1|² is regular and C_5 orbits foliate\nthe surface without fixed points for 0 < r < ∞. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BringSurfaceSmoothness.intrinsic_resolution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BringSurfaceSmoothness.intrinsic_resolution","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/brings-smoothness-resolution.lean#L62-L62","doc":"At each branch point z_c, the local color coordinate δ = x_i - x_j\nsatisfies z - z_c ~ δ², so the blow-up is intrinsic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BringSurfaceSmoothness.transverse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BringSurfaceSmoothness.transverse","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/brings-smoothness-resolution.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The three power-sum constraints are transverse (Jacobian has full rank). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BringSurfaceSmoothness.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BringSurfaceSmoothness.mk","kind":"ctor","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/brings-smoothness-resolution.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BringSurfaceSmoothness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BringSurfaceSmoothness","kind":"structure","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/brings-smoothness-resolution.lean#L50-L65","doc":"**Carrier for the three smoothness conditions**, with the conditions as parameters.\n\nThey are parameters rather than constructions because nothing in this file's import cone\ncan state them: there is no Bring surface object here. Parameterising is what lets the\ncarrier hold the three honestly without either fabricating them or pretending they are\nproved. ","signatureChunk":0}]}